  "body": "# BPfold\r\n- **Motif library**: [energy library](https://github.com/heqin-zhu/BPfold/blob/master/src/BPfold/paras/key.energy)\r\n- `BPfold_data.tar.gz`: Datasets used in BPfold of RNA secondary structures in `.bpseq` format.\r\n  - RNAStrAlign\r\n  - bpRNA\r\n  - bpRNAnew\r\n  - Rfam12.3-14.10\r\n  - PDB\r\n- `BPfold_reproduce.tar.gz`: BPfold model paras for reproducing.\r\n- `BPfold_test_results.tar.gz`: The predicted strctures of BPfold on four test datasets.\r\n- `model_predict.tar.gz`: BPfold model paras for predicting new sequences."
